B.a2X=new A.eT("Use of the App",B.a8d)
B.a9j=s(["Floii provides estimates based on the dates and details you enter. It is **not a medical device** and it does not diagnose, treat, prevent or cure any condition.","!!Do not rely on Floii as a method of contraception.!! Predictions are estimates and can be inaccurate. Always consult a qualified healthcare professional for medical decisions."],t.s)
B.a2T=new A.eT("Not Medical Advice",B.a9j)
B.acK=s(["Predictions improve as you record more cycles, but no prediction is guaranteed. Your cycle can change for many reasons, including stress, illness, travel and medication."],t.s)
B.a2P=new A.eT("Accuracy of Predictions",B.acK)
B.afu=s(["You are responsible for the accuracy of the information you enter and for keeping your own backups. If you lose your device or uninstall the app, data that you have not exported may not be recoverable."],t.s)
B.a2L=new A.eT("Your Content & Responsibilities",B.afu)
B.afa=s(["The app, including its name, logo, design and content, is owned by us or our licensors and is protected by intellectual property laws."],t.s)
B.a2Y=new A.eT("Intellectual Property",B.afa)
B.a81=s(['Floii is provided "as is" and "as available", without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied, including fitness for a particular purpose.'],t.s)
B.a2V=new A.eT("Disclaimer of Warranties",B.a81)
B.afc=s(["To the fullest extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any indirect, incidental or consequential damages arising from your use of, or inability to use, the app."],t.s)
B.a2N=new A.eT("Limitation of Liability",B.afc)
B.a3S=s(["We may update these terms as the app evolves. Continued use of Floii after a change means you accept the updated terms."],t.s)
B.a2J=new A.eT("Changes to These Terms",B.a3S)
B.afd=s(["If you have questions about these terms, reach us through **Send Feedback** in Settings."],t.s)
B.a2U=new A.eT("Contact Us",B.afd)
B.aab=s([B.a2S,B.a2X,B.a2T,B.a2P,B.a2L,B.a2Y,B.a2V,B.a2N,B.a2J,B.a2U],t.J8)
B.vq=new A.Gy("Please read these terms before using Floii. By using the app, you agree to them.",B.aab)
B.a7Y=s(["You may record period dates, cycle length, moods, symptoms, notes and preferences such as language and theme. This information is stored only on your device.","You are **not required** to create an account, and you never have to share your real name or email address to use the app."],t.s)
B.a2W=new A.eT("Information You Provide",B.a7Y)
B.a89=s(["Your entries are used solely to calculate cycle predictions, phase information, statistics and reminders inside the app. All of this happens on your device.","!!Your entries are never sent to us, and they are never used to build an advertising profile.!!"],t.s)
B.a3_=new A.eT("How Your Data Is Used",B.a89)
B.a3A=s(["Data is kept in a local database on your device. Because it never leaves your phone, its security also depends on your device passcode and the protections built into your operating system.","You can export a backup at any time, and you can erase everything from **Settings \u2192 Data \u2192 Factory Reset**. Deleting the app removes its local data as well."],t.s)
B.a2Z=new A.eT("Storage & Security",B.a3A)
B.adn=s(["We do not sell, rent or share your personal data. The app contains no third-party advertising networks and no analytics trackers.","If you choose to send feedback, only the details you type are shared, and only through the channel you pick. Sending feedback is always optional."],t.s)
B.a2I=new A.eT("Sharing & Third Parties",B.adn)
B.acD=s(["If you enable reminders, they are scheduled locally on your device. No reminder content is sent through a server, and you can turn them off at any time in Settings."],t.s)
B.a2O=new A.eT("Notifications",B.acD)
B.acB=s(["Floii is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect information from them."],t.s)
B.a2K=new A.eT("Children's Privacy",B.acB)
B.a6r=s(["You stay in control of your information. You can edit or delete any entry, export a backup, or erase all data from the Data section of Settings."],t.s)
B.a2R=new A.eT("Your Choices",B.a6r)
B.abE=s(["We may update this policy as the app evolves. When we do, we will revise the date shown at the top of this page."],t.s)
